// @error exported function `e`: parameter `x` has no type and nothing in the program calls `e`; the host calls it, so its signature must be explicit. The body fits more than one type (i32, i64, f32, f64, …). Annotate it: `export function e(x: f64)`
// An operator fits every numeric type, so an export nothing calls cannot take its parameter's
